  "design": {
    "idea": "Grand Domed Folio Apse hosting Boss THE ARCHIVIST: counter three borrowed Keeper Chapters (reflecting Ch.1 Fresnel beams off twin mirrors, ringing the Ch.2 Dusk Bell against Briar/Echoes, and punishing Ch.3 Star-Kiln-Hollow bursts) to shatter the Archive Eclipse Seal.",
    "kind": "boss",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Boss-scale synthesis of all 7 prior Island Keepers' counterplay.",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 140,
    "reward": "archive_cleared+half_lantern",
    "why": "Climactic boss of The Archive of Lost Lamps unlocking 2/3 of the Triple Eclipse Seal.",
